     On success, function ddwwaarrff__vveennddoorr__eexxtt() returns DW_DLV_OK.  In case of an
     error, function ddwwaarrff__vveennddoorr__eexxtt() returns DW_DLV_ERROR and sets the ar‐
     gument _e_r_r.

